    "personal_information": "PREETHI.B\nContact:7411081673 | Mail: preethib.7it@gmail.com | Location: Bangalore",
    "summary": "PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Full Stack Developer 3.2 years of Hands-on experience proficient in developing web applications\nusing Angular,Java,Spring Boot and SQL Server,Hibarnet also Skilled in building REST API’S\nfollowing clean code practices, and ensuring high code quality using tools like SonarQube to\nminimimize code complexity and eliminate code smells.",
    "skills": "TECHNICAL SKILL\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProgramming skills: Java 18,Typescript\nFrameworks & Libraries : Spring boot, Angular 15,Hibarnet\nweb Technologies :Angular15 Testing Tools: Junit 5\nDatabase Technologies : MS SQL server\nTools & Platforms: Postman, Eclipse, VS Code",
    "experience": "EXPERIENCE\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ Associate Software Engineer Trinity mobility pvt lvd | Banglore\nMarch 2022 –Sep 2023\nSoftware Engineer Globus info services| Bangalore\nSep 2023 – Present",
    "education": "EDUCATION\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBachelor of Engineering (BE) - Computer Science Gov Engineering collage Huvina Hadagali-Ballary-60%",
    "projects": "PROJECTS ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nProject - 1 Technologies : Java, Angular, SQL, Spring boot, Hibarnet\nTitle : Cad Application\nRole & Responsibilities:\nDeveloped and maintained RESTful APIs using Spring Boot Microservices for event creation and\ndispatch workflows.\nBuilt responsive UI components with Angular 15 to support real-time dashboard updates and\ndispatcher interfaces\nImplemented unit testing using JUnit 5 to ensure backend reliability and reduce bugs.\nCollaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver high-quality, scalable web solutions. Followed clean code practices and used tools like SonarQube to maintain code quality.\nDescription : RESPOND is a Computer-Aided Dispatch (CAD) application built to reduce crime and enable rapid response across the city. When a citizen calls 112 (police emergency number), the call is registered as an event in the system. This event is then dispatched by a controller, who assigns a First Responder (vehicle) to the location for immediate action including call volumes and response status.\nProject -2 Title : Dashboard Technologies : Java, Angular, Sql, Spring boot, Hibarnate : Roles\nUsing Spring Boot and Angular to handle call data and vehicle records. Built dynamic UI components in Angular to display call summaries and incident mappings. Integrated database queries with MySQL to retrieve and manage call logs. Collaborated with a cross-functional team to enhance system reliability and ensure accurate data\nvalidation.\nDescription: The Dashboard is a web application developed to monitor and manage records of\nincoming calls received in the system. It helps categorize calls into types such as Blank Call, Crank Call, and Missed Call. The application also supports vehicle onboarding and cross-verification of calls with registered incident cases for better case tracking and validation."
  },
